      "value": "it would be great if this could be a more sided story.. like a draw call analyzer.. if you stay within a certain low value of draw calls that you get rewarded with a higher poly limit. VRchat is cpu heavy and not so much gpu heavy so it would be nice to stimulate to put more load on a gpu then a cpu",
