      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The poly limit is a bit laughable considering there's NO limit on materials and meshes.\n\nHell, I've had avatars that HAVE to use a double-sided shader, becasue they didn't have the polygon wiggle room to have double faces on the hair. Literally being LESS optimized, because of the poly limit.",
