      "value": "@{5bcbaf75fab2337b72ced6b0|full_name}: If they can't handle VRchat now, then it wouldn't matter.  the polycount is not a huge issue, if your computer is over 10 years old, then VRchat wouldn't be a software you'd be able to run regardless.  \n\nThe issue is VRchat runs on a single core processor, and it's things other than polycount that are the issue.  Polycount is GPU, not CPU",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
