      "value": "@{5b9f6c965a3e1a116727dfa8|full_name}: To me, having that soft limit gives a headsup,  and does limit alot of people who are still new from uploading something massive, but there are other factors that do hinder people, at least while in large groups.\n\nI've had very few people complain about my avatar, which is 11k, but has several dynamic bones, and yet Dynamic bones are supposibly the biggest contributor to lag.  Now... in crowded areas, I could see that as an issue, but in a low pop setting, low impact world, it's not a problem.",
